stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> intake
    intake --> available: operator activates\nall 5 evidence types valid
    available --> reserved: operator approves\nrequested contract
    reserved --> active_access: handover evidence\noperator handover
    active_access --> return_pending: worker begins return
    return_pending --> available: return evidence\noperator closes contract
    reserved --> available: worker cancels approved contract
    available --> retired: operator retires asset
    available --> maintenance_hold: operator maintenance hold
    reserved --> safety_hold: operator suspends contract
    active_access --> safety_hold: operator suspends contract
    return_pending --> safety_hold: operator suspends contract
    safety_hold --> return_pending: operator begins safe return
    maintenance_hold --> intake: remediation and re-verification

    state contract_flow {
      [*] --> requested
      requested --> approved: operator approve
      approved --> active: handover proof + operator handover
      active --> return_pending: worker begins return
      return_pending --> closed: return proof + operator close
      requested --> cancelled: worker cancel
      approved --> cancelled: worker cancel
      approved --> suspended: operator suspend
      active --> suspended: operator suspend
      return_pending --> suspended: operator suspend
      suspended --> return_pending: operator safe return
    }
